window.docContents[84].resolve({"/Basic-Types/Maps-and-Sets/#Lean-__________________--Basic-Types--Maps-and-Sets--Extensional-Hash-Maps--Conversion":{"contents":"Creates a hash map from a list of mappings. If the same key appears multiple times, the last\noccurrence takes precedence.\n\nCreates a hash map from an array of keys, associating the value () with each key.This is mainly useful to implement HashSet.ofArray, so if you are considering using this,\nHashSet or HashSet.Raw might be a better fit for you.\n\nCreates a hash map from a list of keys, associating the value () with each key.This is mainly useful to implement HashSet.ofList, so if you are considering using this,\nHashSet or HashSet.Raw might be a better fit for you.\n\n","context":"Lean 中文参考手册\u0009Basic Types\u0009Maps and Sets\u0009Extensional Hash Maps","header":"20.19.4.6. Conversion","id":"/Basic-Types/Maps-and-Sets/#Lean-__________________--Basic-Types--Maps-and-Sets--Extensional-Hash-Maps--Conversion"},"/Functors___-Monads-and--do--Notation/Syntax/#early-return":{"contents":"提前返回会立即以给定值终止计算。\n该值从包含它的最近 do 块返回；但这个块未必由最近的 do 关键字引入。\n确定 do 块范围的规则在专门的一节中介绍。\n\n提前返回\n\n并非所有单子都包含提前返回。\n因此，当 do 块包含 return 时，需要改写代码来模拟这一效果。\n在单子 m 中使用提前返回来计算 α 类型值的程序，可以视为单子 ExceptT α m α 中的程序：提前返回的值走异常路径，普通返回则不走。\n随后，外层处理器可以返回任一路径产生的值。\n在内部，do 精译器执行的翻译与此非常相似。\n\n单独使用时，return 是 return​ ​() 的简写。\n\n","context":"Lean 中文参考手册\u0009函子、单子与  do  记法\u0009语法\u0009do  记法","header":"18.3.2.2. 提前返回","id":"/Functors___-Monads-and--do--Notation/Syntax/#early-return"},"/Type-Classes/Instance-Declarations/#instance-priorities":{"contents":"可以为实例分配 优先级。\n在实例合成期间，更高优先级的实例会被优先考虑；有关实例合成的详情，请参阅 实例合成小节。\n\n实例优先级优先级可以是数字：如果没有指定优先级，则使用对应于 1000 的默认优先级：当数字值太细粒度时，有三种命名优先级可用，分别对应于 100、500 和 10000。\nmid 优先级低于 default。最后，优先级还可以做加减法，因此 default + 2 也是个有效的优先级，对应于 1002：\n\n","context":"Lean 中文参考手册\u0009类型类\u0009实例声明","header":"10.2.3. 实例优先级","id":"/Type-Classes/Instance-Declarations/#instance-priorities"},"/releases/v4.0.0-m2/#release-v4___0___0-m2":{"contents":"This is the second milestone release of Lean 4. With too many improvements and bug fixes in almost all parts of the system to list, we would like to single out major improvements to simp and other built-in tactics as well as support for a goal view that make the proving experience more comfortable.\n\n","context":"Lean 中文参考手册\u0009Release Notes","header":"Lean 4.0.0-m2 (2021-03-02)","id":"/releases/v4.0.0-m2/#release-v4___0___0-m2"},"/releases/v4.26.0/#Lean-__________________--Release-Notes--Lean-4___26___0-_LPAR_2025-12-13_RPAR_--Highlights--Dependencies-by-Semantic-Version":{"contents":"#10959 enables Lake users to require Reservoir dependencies by a\nsemantic version range. On a lake update, Lake will fetch the\npackage's version information from Reservoir and select the newest\nversion of the package that satisfies the range.\n\n","context":"Lean 中文参考手册\u0009Release Notes\u0009Lean 4.26.0 (2025-12-13)\u0009Highlights","header":"Dependencies by Semantic Version","id":"/releases/v4.26.0/#Lean-__________________--Release-Notes--Lean-4___26___0-_LPAR_2025-12-13_RPAR_--Highlights--Dependencies-by-Semantic-Version"}});